{"id":"smith_seated_calf_raise","name":"Smith seated calf raise","cue":"Sink your heels into a deep stretch, pause, then press up.","research":"Seated calf raise on a Smith machine (science audit table B: the Smith alternative to the plate-loaded seated calf raise). Seated upright on a flat bench (a 0.19 H wide pad on two posts and a centre rail; sit bones on the pad, pin), knees 90 deg, hips 90, the balls of the feet on the rear edge of an 18 cm foot block, heels free, a padded bar across the lower thighs just above the kneecaps, hands on the bar outside the pad. With the knee bent about 90 deg the gastrocnemius is slack and the soleus does most of the work (Kinoshita 2023, Front Physiol 14:1272106). Range: the bottom half, as in the lever machine: ankle 25 deg dorsiflexion (heels below the block top) to 5 deg plantarflexion, 1.5 s pause in the stretch. The pose keys (hip, knee, ankle, toe) are those of the lever machine, solved so the toe joint never leaves the block edge (rolling contact; hip 90 -> 100, knee 90 -> 98). The pad is on the Smith carriage, which slides on vertical rails 0.36 H out at 0.185 H ahead of the hips: its height is solved per key so the pad rides 2 mm off the thigh skin (the knees rise 0.028 H, the contact point moves about 0.01 H along the thigh). Plates on the bar ends. Muscles: soleus primary, the gastrocnemius amber.","targets":{"tol":10,"A":{"trunk_flexion":0,"hip_flexion":90,"knee_flexion":90,"ankle_dorsiflexion":25},"B":{"trunk_flexion":0,"hip_flexion":100,"knee_flexion":95,"ankle_dorsiflexion":-5}},"muscles":{"primary":["soleus"],"secondary":["gastroc"],"side":"both"},"camera":{"az":90,"el":0,"dAz":28,"dEl":-5,"fill":0.64,"note":"Research view az 90 / el 0 (the right profile at calf height). Turned 28 deg toward the rear and dropped 5 deg (az 118 / el -5): the posterolateral calves face the camera, the soleus (ember) under the gastrocnemius (amber), the heels visible dropping below the block at the stretch. The near plate and rail stand beside the thigh, above the calves."},"rhythm":false,"motion":{"tempo":[1,0.2,2,1.5],"root":[0,0.3444,0],"base":{"pelvis":{"flex":0},"lumbar":{"flex":0},"thorax":{"flex":0},"neck":{"flex":2},"head":{"flex":4},"thigh_l":{"abd":0},"clav_l":{"elev":-3},"arm_l":{"plane":17.7,"elev":43.5,"rot":17.7},"fore_l":{"flex":71.6},"hand_l":{"pro":90}},"keys":{"A":{"thigh_l":{"flex":89.99,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":89.988},"foot_l":{"dorsi":25},"toe_l":{"ext":-25.002},"m":{"bar":0}},"M1":{"thigh_l":{"flex":91.851,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":91.936},"foot_l":{"dorsi":20},"toe_l":{"ext":-19.915},"m":{"bar":0.1724}},"M2":{"thigh_l":{"flex":93.638,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":93.596},"foot_l":{"dorsi":15},"toe_l":{"ext":-15.042},"m":{"bar":0.3448}},"M3":{"thigh_l":{"flex":95.349,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":94.991},"foot_l":{"dorsi":10},"toe_l":{"ext":-10.358},"m":{"bar":0.5517}},"M4":{"thigh_l":{"flex":96.98,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":96.14},"foot_l":{"dorsi":5},"toe_l":{"ext":-5.84},"m":{"bar":0.7241}},"M5":{"thigh_l":{"flex":98.529,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":97.062},"foot_l":{"dorsi":0},"toe_l":{"ext":-1.467},"m":{"bar":0.8621}},"B":{"thigh_l":{"flex":99.991,"abd":0},"shank_l":{"flex":97.773},"foot_l":{"dorsi":-5},"toe_l":{"ext":2.782},"m":{"bar":1}}},"timeline":[{"phase":"con","from":"A","via":["M1","M2","M3","M4","M5"],"at":[0,0.1667,0.3333,0.5,0.6667,0.8333,1],"to":"B","dur":1},{"phase":"hold","at":"B","dur":0.2},{"phase":"ecc","from":"B","via":["M5","M4","M3","M2","M1"],"at":[0,0.1667,0.3333,0.5,0.6667,0.8333,1],"to":"A","dur":2,"ease":"ecc"},{"phase":"pause","at":"A","dur":1.5}]},"pins":[{"landmark":"ischia_c","to":"seat_top"}],"contacts":[{"landmark":"thigh_top_l","to":"kneepad","tol":0.012}],"skinChecks":[{"part":"step","bones":["toe_l","toe_r"],"maxGap":0.004,"maxPen":0.004,"note":"forefoot stays on the block through the loop"},{"part":"kneepad","bones":["thigh_l","thigh_r"],"maxGap":0.004,"maxPen":0.004,"note":"roller stays on the lower thighs"},{"part":"rail","bones":["foo